# No export-ignore here: the Anthropic plugin directory refuses to validate a
# repository whose .gitattributes uses export-ignore or export-subst. Nothing
# depended on it: the claude.ai .skill bundle is built from an explicit
# allowlist (tools/build_skill_bundle.py), and Claude Code installs the plugin
# from a git checkout, not `git archive`.

# Byte-exact checkouts on every platform: the execution-registry validator
# (tools/validate_v1_execution.py) and bundle checksums require committed
# bytes to arrive unmodified. Windows core.autocrlf=true otherwise rewrites
# LF->CRLF at checkout and the validator correctly refuses the rewrite.
* -text
